<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">leather-bandolier</ansi> (tailoring recipe)

A wide leather belt fitted with loops and pockets for carrying
vials and bottles. Worn in the belt slot, it gives quick access
to potions but offers no armor protection.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       tailoring (minimum 10)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     loom
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> leather strip (x2), thread spool (x1),
                 bone needle (x1)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Capacity:</ansi>    12 potions

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help tailoring</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help craft</ansi>
